title: Economic Programme
subtitle: Up to three priorities of PPS for the economy.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_economic_program.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.programmeAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.economic_program (technical reference 10.5; card catalogue 6.2): the whole set of 0–3
// priorities in one transaction, 1 T, cd 6 M; the present set can be confirmed too (Z — 0.51).
Q.pl_prog_draft = Q.S.actors.pps.strategy.economic_priorities.join(',');
PolishParty.programmeView(Q);
!}

= Economic programme

The present programme: [+ pl_prog_current +]. Choose up to three priorities, then confirm the set. The priorities prepare nothing by themselves; each programme still needs its card, its law, its money and its executor.

- @edit
- @easy_discard

@edit
title: Compose the programme
go-to: menu

@menu
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeView(Q);
!}

= The new programme

Chosen: [+ pl_prog_draft_text +]. Nothing is spent until you confirm.

- @toggle_stabilisation_with_protection
- @toggle_public_works
- @toggle_wealth_and_investment
- @toggle_socialisation
- @toggle_agrarian_labour
- @confirm
- @polish_party_economic_program: Start again.

@toggle_stabilisation_with_protection
title: Stabilisation with protections
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_stabilisation_with_protection_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_stabilisation_with_protection_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'stabilisation_with_protection');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_public_works
title: Public works and employment
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_public_works_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_public_works_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'public_works');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_wealth_and_investment
title: Wealth taxes and capital for investment
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_wealth_and_investment_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_wealth_and_investment_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'wealth_and_investment');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_socialisation
title: Socialisation of selected enterprises
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_socialisation_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_socialisation_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'socialisation');
!}
go-to: menu

@toggle_agrarian_labour
title: An agrarian and workers’ programme
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_agrarian_labour_in = 1 : Chosen — remove it from the set. ?][? if pl_prog_agrarian_labour_in = 0 : Add it to the set. ?]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeToggle(Q, 'agrarian_labour');
!}
go-to: menu

@confirm
title: Confirm the programme
subtitle: [? if pl_prog_confirm_same = 1 : **Present programme** Confirming it costs this month's action and the card waits six months; nothing else changes. ?][? if pl_prog_confirm_same = 0 : Costs this month's action; the card then waits six months. ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.programmeStatus(Q, String(Q.pl_prog_draft || '').split(',').filter(Boolean)).available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_prog_confirm_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.programmeChoose(Q, String(Q.pl_prog_draft || '').split(',').filter(Boolean));
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Economic programme

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
